    "text": "\u00c6t Witlea, Wulfgare.\nIc Osuuald \u00feurh Godes giefe arcebisceop mid ge\u00feafunge & leafe Eadwardes Angulcyning\u00e6s & \u00c6lfheres\nSit autem terra ista libera omni regi nisi ecclesiastici censi.\nSancta (10) Maria & Sanctus Michahel cum sancto Petro & allum Godes halgum gemiltsien \u00feis\nGief hwa buton gewrihtum hit abrecan wille h\u00e6bbe him wi\u00f0 God gem\u00e6ne on \u00feam ytemestan d\u00e6ge\n\u00deis sindon \u00fe\u00e6s landes gem\u00e6ra \u00fee gebyria\u00f0 into \u00fe\u00e6re westmestan hide \u00e6t Witleage, feldlondes &\nOf \u00f0rym gem\u00e6ran westrihte on \u00fea dic.\nAndlang dices on kyllan hrigc.\nOf kyllan hrigce on sylweg.\nAndlang weges on \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feihtan leage & swa on \u00fe\u00e6t fule sloh.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m slo ofer buttingc graf on eccles broc.\nAndlang broces on doferic.",
